    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516000/extras/3abaec8473f05d55ab9310e35d1eac3c.avif?t=1750974533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crypt</strong> is a sinister idle management game that plunges you into the depths of the underworld, where serving the dark overlords is the only way to escape eternal damnation.<br><br> <strong>Master Relentless Soul Extraction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than suffer for eternity, you strike a twisted bargain: torture and harvest the souls of mortals to spare your own. But your task is far from simple - expanding your Crypt empire means mastering the relentless art of soul extraction, upgrading your nightmarish operations, and fending off relentless crusaders from the realm of light who seek to end your reign.<br><br> <strong>Fend off the Forces of Light!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to power as the master of the damned, or will the forces of light purge your wicked domain? The abyss awaits.<br><br>A great twist on idle games such as AdVenture Capitalist and Dungeons Inc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516000/extras/3abaec8473f05d55ab9310e35d1eac3c.avif?t=1750974533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crypt</strong> is a sinister idle management game that plunges you into the depths of the underworld, where serving the dark overlords is the only way to escape eternal damnation.<br><br> <strong>Master Relentless Soul Extraction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than suffer for eternity, you strike a twisted bargain: torture and harvest the souls of mortals to spare your own. But your task is far from simple - expanding your Crypt empire means mastering the relentless art of soul extraction, upgrading your nightmarish operations, and fending off relentless crusaders from the realm of light who seek to end your reign.<br><br> <strong>Fend off the Forces of Light!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to power as the master of the damned, or will the forces of light purge your wicked domain? The abyss awaits.<br><br>A great twist on idle games such as AdVenture Capitalist and Dungeons Inc.</p>",
